  concept: "Authored objective: Wire the smart microgrid.\nAuthored requirement:
    Recorded from the electrical graph, valid calibrated feedback and the level\u2019s
    verified run history. voltage \u2265 4.8 V. voltage \u2264 5.2 V.\nGeneral teaching
    principle: Power networks require reference conditions, protection coordination
    and validated dynamic behavior before synchronism or restoration can be declared.\nOnly
    fresh, authoritative game evidence can establish that this objective is complete."
  analogy: Two teams must match pace and direction before joining efforts; connected
    grids also require compatible conditions.
  diagram: '[Authored setup] -> [Check prerequisites] -> [Observe the game evidence]
    -> [Verify objective]'
  misconception: Successful energization alone does not guarantee stable or protected
    grid operation.
